3 OpenParlData

Source: OpenParlData.ch
License of the data: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
The README files and the technical report use facts from the OpenParlData exports of 04.10.2026, 13:26 UTC. Examples are the numbers of parliaments, affairs and documents.
Exports: https://files.openparldata.ch/exports/
Changes: the project calculated numbers and shares from the exports. This repository contains no export, no PDF document and no text of a document.
The scripts in `track_2a/src/` download the exports and the PDF documents from https://files.openparldata.ch/.

4 eCH-0295

ParlPDFeCH uses the working draft eCH-0295 (version I95) of the expert group "Politische Geschäfte" of the association eCH:
https://github.com/swiss/political-affairs-ech-group, commit 3cab44d (30.09.2026). eCH-0295 is a working draft. It is not approved.
ParlPDFeCH is an independent project. It is not a product of the association eCH.
This repository contains no copy of eCH-0295 files. The code uses the names of fields and values of eCH-0295.

