5 Apertus

This repository contains no Apertus weights and no Apertus files. A container image of this project must contain none.
Apertus-v1.5-8B: https://huggingface.co/swiss-ai/Apertus-v1.5-8B, license Apache-2.0.
Apertus Acceptable Use Policy v1.5: https://github.com/swiss-ai/apertus-legal/blob/main/apertus_1.5/USAGE_POLICY.pdf
Each user gets access to Apertus with an own account and must obey the license and the Acceptable Use Policy.

